@startuml
title UC-FL-003 提交部门阶段成果 — 分析序列图
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F5FAFF
skinparam classBorderColor #46637F
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 45
hide footbox
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor white
actor "阶段承接成员" as A
boundary "接口:普通成员接口" as B
control "控制:提交部门阶段成果控制" as C
participant "M:成员" as M
participant "F:流转任务" as F
participant "G:任务阶段" as G
participant "O:成果" as O
participant "V:稿件版本" as V
A -> B: 提交部门阶段成果(业务信息)
activate B
B -> C: 提交部门阶段成果(业务信息)
activate C
C -> M: 验证业务资格(操作人、部门与职责)
M --> C: 资格结论
break 无权执行
  C --> B: 拒绝结果及原因
  B --> A: 拒绝结果及原因
end

C -> F: 提交阶段成果(承接人、阶段、成果与贡献依据)
activate F
F -> G: 提交成果(承接人、成果与贡献依据)
activate G
G -> O: 验证完整性(成果材料)
O --> G: 完整性结论
opt 稿件成果
  G -> V: 验证送审条件(本版材料及已有结论)
  V --> G: 需一审、需二审、可发布或须重新审核
end
G --> F: 待审、待确认或拒绝结果
deactivate G
F --> C: 提交结果
deactivate F

C --> B: 业务结果或拒绝原因
deactivate C
B --> A: 业务结果或拒绝原因
deactivate B
@enduml
